cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use HaiBrainLab in teaching or research, please cite it as below."
title: "HaiBrainLab: an interactive neuroscience simulator for learners, teachers and computing-education research"
authors:
  - family-names: Nguyen
    given-names: Hai
version: 1.6.0
date-released: 2026-11-04
license: MIT
keywords:
  - neuroscience education
  - computational neuroscience
  - Hodgkin-Huxley
  - spiking neural network
  - computing education
  - language learning
abstract: >
  HaiBrainLab is a browser-based simulator covering the neuron (Hodgkin-Huxley, integrate-and-fire,
  Izhikevich), the synapse (conductance-based transmission and STDP), a 1000-neuron cortical network,
  a procedurally generated 3D brain atlas, animated scenarios of learning and emotion, a language-learning
  classroom module and a research module on the neuroscience of learning to program.
